                <pb facs="0282" n="182" sameAs="frus:frus1920v03/pg182"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">812.6363/721: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        Mr. Robert Murray</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1920-09-07"><hi rendition="#italic">September 7,
                        1920</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The Chief of the Division of Mexican Affairs of Department of State will be
                    pleased to discuss with Mr. Pesqueira, matters mentioned in your telegram of
                    September 5th.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Bainbridge Colby</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
